WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.976
To mark many orders as Dispatched at once, go to Orders, click Actions, then Import dispatched list.

00:00:07.427 --> 00:00:10.875
Choose SASH India's dispatched list, the Excel file.

00:00:11.328 --> 00:00:16.413
The app marks the matching orders as Dispatched, and lists any rows it could not match.

00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:19.606
Uploading the same list twice is safe.

00:00:19.606 --> 00:00:21.410
Nothing is counted twice.
